  "releaseNotes": "Fix: with TEST_ENV or TestSettings.Load(environment), testsettings.{environment}.json now reaches the http, kafka, rabbitmq and playwright sections, laid over testsettings.json; it was read only for testMode and environment. No code changes needed from 6.13.1; check that your environment files hold what you expect, since they now take effect. Upgrade guide: https://github.com/andrewBezerra/xunit-assured-net/blob/main/UPGRADING.md",
